          "thread": "Institutional TAO products",
          "why": "The Safello staked TAO ETP on Nasdaq Stockholm and Grayscale's amended S-1 framed TAO as an investable asset class, attracting readers watching for regulated on-ramps to AI-adjacent tokens."
