        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "'Bitcoin of AI' investment thesis",
          "why": "The framing of TAO as proof-of-intelligence rather than proof-of-work gave readers a narrative hook to evaluate the token as a macro bet on decentralized compute, not just a DeFi yield play."
