        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Decentralized 72B model training",
          "why": "The Covenant-72B milestone offered rare technical proof that distributed AI training could compete with centralized supercluster results, anchoring NVIDIA CEO endorsement and a TAO price surge."
        }
